# Frontend — TanStack Start

## Project Facts

- Framework: TanStack Start (React 19, SSR)
- Routing: TanStack Router (file-based, `src/routes/`)
- Data fetching: TanStack Query
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4
- Components: shadcn/ui
- Icons: lucide-react
- Linter/Formatter: Biome
- Package manager: pnpm

## Route Conventions

- Routes live in `src/routes/` as file-based routes
- Nested routes use folder structure: `src/routes/plans/$planId.tsx`
- Index routes: `src/routes/plans/index.tsx`

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
export const Route = createFileRoute('/plans/$planId')({
  component: PlanDetail,
})

// ❌ BAD — don't use react-router or next/link
```

## Data Fetching

- Use TanStack Query for all server state
- Define query options alongside the route or in `src/lib/queries/`
- Prefer `useSuspenseQuery` inside routes that use `loader`

## API Client

- All backend calls go through `src/lib/api.ts`
- Backend base URL from env: `VITE_API_URL`

## Key Screens to Build

| Route | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/` | Plans list + New Plan button |
| `/plans/new` | Risk appetite selector |
| `/plans/$planId` | Plan detail — suggestions, select pairs |
